# A deathmatch of one player, which the timer ends after one minute:
# the matrix of frags, and then the map.
2100 down ctrl          # fires, with no enemy to kill
2110 up ctrl
2145 shot stats1.ppm
2200 shot stats2.ppm
2250 press space        # goes on to the map
2260 shot map.ppm
2500 shot next.ppm
2550 quit
